# SSH public keys of the Meltingplot administrators.
#
# Every key listed here can log in as mpadmin, and mpadmin can become root
# with sudo, on every image built from this tree: from the printer network
# only, never from the machine itself and so never through a Raspberry Pi
# Connect remote shell (layer/mp-admin.yaml). Keys held on a hardware token
# such as a Nitrokey only, so that a copied file never becomes root on a
# printer.
#
# The file is installed on the read-only root, so it is the complete list: a
# key added on a device is not accepted, and a key removed here stops working
# on a printer with the update that carries the change. An image built
# without a key has no root at all.
#
# Public keys only. Never put a private key or an auth key in this repository -
# it is public.
#
# One key per line, e.g.
# ecdsa-sha2-nistp256 AAAAE2Vj... tim@meltingplot.net
ecdsa-sha2-nistp256 AAAAE2VjZHNhLXNoYTItbmlzdHAyNTYAAAAIbmlzdHAyNTYAAABBBAEBbxFnUif5H+tB0GVCebAU6c5F5+Kmn60nsaXalg4HCGbJFXUUpMniRcEBOONGo8QV05emllEnC3OvNVpEKOU= tim@meltingplot.net
